Error-LoginRequirements:
The login must meet the following requirements:
 - Only Latin letters (A–Z, a–z), digits (0–9), and underscores (_);
 - No spaces or special characters (@, !, #, etc.);
 - Length must be between 3 and 20 characters.

Error-NameRequirements:
First name/last name must meet the following requirements:
- Only Russian or Latin alphabet letters are allowed (A–Z, А–Я);
- Must be between 2 and 30 characters long;
- Numbers, spaces, and special characters (!, -, _, etc.) are not permitted.

Error-PassRequirements:
Password must meet the following requirements:
    - Must be between 6 and 30 characters long;
    - Must contain at least one lowercase letter (a–z);
    - Must contain at least one uppercase letter (A–Z);
    - Must contain at least one digit (0–9).
